18. Definition of Done

The feature is complete only when the following experience works end to end:

I launch Quick Battle, select my fighter, and play normally.

When a winner is determined, the game announces either VICTORY! or DEFEAT. depending on my result. If the game ends in a draw, it announces GAME.

The game does not stop.

If the CPU won, it begins behaving like a celebrating fighter. It may randomly spam abilities, dash dance, repeatedly jump, idle, or deliberately run into the Void.

If it falls into the Void, it disappears and never respawns.

If I am still alive, I can continue controlling my fighter after the match. If I fall into the Void, I also never respawn.

