The simulation continues behind the dialog.

The dialog has an X at the top-right, and four actions at the bottom: Rematch, Change fighters, Change stage, and Return to Home Screen.

All actions work correctly and lead to their appropriate screens.

Meanwhile, ordinary gameplay-pausing dialogs consistently have an X button and a Settings gear immediately beside it.

